# Image and Graphic Interpretation

This component investigates limitations of Large Language Models (LLMs) in interpreting complex graphics and diagrams.

Different LLM providers were evaluated to compare their performance in extracting structured information from graphical supply chain documentation. In addition, an alternative approach was tested in which graphics were divided into smaller segments to improve interpretation accuracy.

This folder includes:
- The original document used for testing (Supply Chain Map)
- LLM-generated outputs from different models
- Comparative analysis of the results and evaluation of output accuracy
